      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor is always so rushed and i feel like he just brushes off my mental health stuff. is it really that bad? i heard most natural stuff is fine with meds as long as you dont take too much. like if i just take a small dose of the tea or something it wouldnt really mess with my blood thinning much right?",
